      "text": "Identify the best possible option for shoreline restoration in Oswego, NY from the Shoreline Engineering Solutions chart based on the associated cost, reliability, and aesthetics. Evaluate the social and environmental impacts of this solution using those criteria and their trade-offs. Life Science:",
